SUMMARY:KCRW Presents: Moon Panda
LOCATION:The Moroccan Lounge\, Downtown
DESCRIPTION:KCRW Presents: Moon Panda [December 2\, 2026 / Doors 6:30pm / $
 
15 adv / $18 dos / All Ages] There?s a strange comfort in knowing someone y
 
ou love is out there somewhere\, under the same sky. Moon Panda make music 
 
for that kind of feeling - dreamy\, intimate and a little otherworldly\, wi
 
th warm grooves\, hazy guitars and strange little synth sounds floating som
 
ewhere between the 70s and whatever decade we?re heading into. There?s alwa
 
ys been a gentle push and pull to their world: drowsy but bright-eyed\, nos
 
talgic but never quite looking backwards\, soft around the edges while occa
 
sionally saying something rather sharp. At its heart\, Moon Panda is music 
 
about feeling close - to another person\, to a place\, or to some half-reme
 
mbered version of yourself. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/kc
 
rw-presents-moon-panda-los-angeles-california-12-02-2026/event/09006527DA54
 
8ECE
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/kcrw-presents-moon-panda-los-angeles-calif
 
ornia-12-02-2026/event/09006527DA548ECE
