SUMMARY:BEAT: Belew/Vai/Levin/Bozzio Performing the Music of KING CRIMSON
LOCATION:YouTube Theater\, Inglewood
DESCRIPTION:Following more than 100 acclaimed performances across North and
 
 South America\, Europe\, and Japan\, BEAT returns this fall for the last N
 
orth American tour. Former King Crimson members Adrian Belew and Tony Levin
 
 are joined by guitar virtuoso Steve Vai and legendary drummer Terry Bozzio
 
 to perform the music of the three landmark 1980s King Crimson albums Disci
 
pline\, Beat\, and Three of a Perfect Pair. Rather than attempting to recre
 
ate the original recordings\, BEAT brings this extraordinary music to life 
 
with the spirit\, precision\, and adventurousness that made it so enduring.
 
 Whether you've lived with these albums for decades or are discovering them
 
 for the first time\, this is the final opportunity to experience one of pr
 
ogressive music's most celebrated catalogs performed by four of the best mu
 
sicians on the planet. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/beat-be
 
lewvailevinbozzio-performing-the-music-of-inglewood-california-12-02-2026/e
 
vent/0A0064FEFC6652B8
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/beat-belewvailevinbozzio-performing-the-mu
 
sic-of-inglewood-california-12-02-2026/event/0A0064FEFC6652B8
END:VEVENT
