SUMMARY:Devkota: Recovery Nights
LOCATION:The Moroccan Lounge\, Downtown
DESCRIPTION:The Moroccan Lounge Presents: Devkota: Recovery Nights with sup
 
port from David Lee [December 2\, 2026 / Doors 9:30pm / $15 adv / $18 dos /
 
 All Ages] Twenty-one-year-old R&B singer Devkota went from singing for str
 
angers outside a mall to more than 52 million streams in under two years. B
 
orn in Nepal and raised in Orange County\, California from age 15\, he grew
 
 up on Michael Jackson and Prince before The Weeknd showed him where modern
 
 R&B could go. His breakout single "Figure You Out" hit #1 on Spotify's Vir
 
al 50 UK\, #4 on Viral 50 Global and #3 in Belgium. It peaked at 500K daily
 
 streams and broke into Shazam's US chart\, earning a co-sign from Swae Lee
 
 along the way. With just a handful of songs he's built an audience of 2.1 
 
million monthly listeners. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/dev
 
kota-recovery-nights-los-angeles-california-12-02-2026/event/09006549EE0B4E
 
78
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/devkota-recovery-nights-los-angeles-califo
 
rnia-12-02-2026/event/09006549EE0B4E78
